WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.840
Claude designed novel protein binders from scratch for 14 of 15 targets, with 22 to 35 percent success rates that beat the field's typical 10 to 15 percent. This is Models &amp; Agents, episode 146. Andthropic demonstrated Claude autonomously creating functional protein binders that were then built and validated by adaptive bio and twist bioscience. Open weight releases from Ornith and Inclusion ai add new dense

