and MOE options for local use. Open ai paused frontier RL training for two weeks to strengthen security and monitoring before resuming larger runs. Anthropic tested whether Claude could perform denovo protein binder design, using a prompt written by a human expert.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:01:09.480
The model produced candidate binders against 14 out of 15 targets, independent labs synthesized and tested the designs, confirming that 22 to 35 percent of them bound successfully, depending on the experimental setup. Some binders showed several times tighter affinity than the best previously published denovo examples.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:25.880
Protein binders represent only the first step toward drug development, not drugs themselves. Anthropic also reiterated plans to launch a scientist access program and noted that Opus 5 remains its most capable model for life science research.

