These scores place the 397 billion model in the same range as Claude Opus 4.8 on reasoning, agentic, and coding tasks. Checkpoints are available on hugging face under the Ornith ai collection.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:28.400
Inclusion ai released six base model checkpoints for the Ling 3.0 tiny base, at 7.9 billion active parameters, and the Ling 3.0 flash base at 124 billion total, with 5.1 billion active.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:36.400
