00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:08.340
The WSM merging technique replaces traditional learning rate decay, enabling offline exploration of different decay strategies on the shared training recipe.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:21.300
A controlled head-to-head compared Kimi K3, with a full 127,000 token prompt, against a top 5 rag pipeline on the same 12 questions, using identical system prompts.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:27.800
